WEBVTT - Testing and code quality: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.049
A bug that comes back should have been a test
the first time.

2
00:00:07.149 --> 00:00:12.909
Testing and code quality: four skills for TYPO3
v14.

3
00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:21.797
Unit, functional and end-to-end tests, and a
reported bug reproduced as a failing test first.

4
00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:28.593
A test written after the fix proves only that
the code does what it does.

5
00:00:29.993 --> 00:00:36.797
Builds and repairs Playwright tests for visitor
and editor journeys, with isolated fixtures.

6
00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:43.071
A unit test cannot click a filter or save a link
dialog.

7
00:00:44.471 --> 00:00:53.156
Checks an extension against TYPO3 standards:
versions, coding standards, deprecations and TER
readiness.

8
00:00:54.506 --> 00:00:59.404
A version bump that leaves half the files behind
is easy to miss.

9
00:01:00.804 --> 00:01:07.635
Cleans up extension code for clarity and v14
patterns without changing what it does.

10
00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:16.756
It replaces custom code with what TYPO3 already
provides, and checks that the behaviour stays
the same.

11
00:01:18.356 --> 00:01:22.600
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
